    <string name="help_title">How to use</string>
    <string name="help_body">Kausar Recorder is developed by Alkausar.\n\n• Recording type: choose Screen or Voice.\n• Audio source: Microphone only, Internal audio, or Internal + mic.\n• Format: AAC or WAV.\n• Effects: Studio (clean), Flanger, Echo, V8 Reverb.\n• Microphone strength: adjust input volume.\n• Noise level: adjust soft background noise (optional).\n• Force stereo: widen mono to stereo.\n• Noise mode: soft Windows-like noise floor.\n• Skip silence: ignore very quiet parts.\n• Dynamic gain: boost quiet speech automatically.\n• Bookmark: mark timestamps while recording.\n• Files are saved under KausarRecorder (Audio / Screen).\n• While recording, use the notification for Pause / Resume / Stop.\n\nAfter stop, choose Save, Play, Share, or Share and save.</string>
